{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/group(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/group(_:)"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"group","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(repeat (each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":").Type)","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Group.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Group.swift#L70"},"title":"group(_:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","extendedModule":"WorldModule","externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A0V5groupyyxmxQpRvzAA9ComponentRzlF"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Speeding Up Queries","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/group(checked:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/cache(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/index(_:)-u1gw","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/index(_:)-2gtfg","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/lookup(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/lookup(_:equals:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/index(ordered:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/lookup(_:in:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/entities(sortedBy:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Speeding-Up-Queries"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps the given component types packed in the same order, so that queries and updates of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exactly these types visit their entities without lookups."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"group"},{"kind":"text","text":"<each "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"types","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": repeat (each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":").Type) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP","text":"Component"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The component types to keep packed together.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"types"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A query of several types normally walks one type’s storage and looks up the entity in each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the others. After you group the types, the entities that hold all of them sit at the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"front of each type’s storage, at the same positions, and spawning, inserting, removing and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"despawning keep them there. A query of the same types in any order, or an update that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"writes and reads exactly those types, walks that front directly.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use a group for a set of types you visit together on every step, such as position and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"velocity:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","let comet = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 2))","world.spawn(Position(x: 9, y: 9))","world.group(Position.self, Velocity.self)","","world.update(Position.self, reading: Velocity.self) { position, row in","    position.x += row.components.dx","    position.y += row.components.dy","}","print(world[Position.self, of: comet])","\/\/ Prints \"Position(x: 1.0, y: 2.0)\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Grouping doesn’t change which entities a query or update visits, only how it finds them."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It does change the order queries list entities in, and makes adding and removing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"grouped types a little slower. Each type belongs to at most one group. A copy of the world"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps the group; a snapshot doesn’t."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Complexity","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"·"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"t","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":" entities in the smallest of the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"t"}]},{"type":"text","text":" types."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"},{"name":"Precondition","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"types"},{"type":"text","text":" lists at least two distinct types, and no other group owns any of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them. The checked spelling, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/group(checked:)"},{"type":"text","text":", throws instead."}]}],"style":"note"}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"]]},"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/index(_:)-u1gw":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"index"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type)"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/index(_:)-u1gw","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"index(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a map from each value of a component type to the entities holding it, so that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/lookup(_:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" finds them without walking the type’s storage."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/index(_:)-u1gw"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"World"}],"title":"World","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A collection of entities, the components they hold, and resources.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"World"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/lookup(_:in:)":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/lookup(_:in:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"lookup"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text